---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: check caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller not authorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller authorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_state: sale not ended
    q_revert_state --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_check_refund: sale ended
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_refund: global refund period not complete
    q_revert_refund --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodNotEnded
    q_check_refund --> q_set_capital: refund period complete
    q_set_capital --> [*]: set totalCapitalRaised, capitalPublished = true, emit RaisedCapitalPublished

    note right of q_set_capital
        INV-001: totalCapitalRaised <= totalCapitalInvested
        INV-002: published after all per-investor refund windows expire
    end note
